                 rdfs:label "Soulbond" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that makes creatures better by pairing
them together."""@en .
:Soulshift rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Soulshift" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a player return a card from
their graveyard to their hand."""@en .
:SpaceSculptor rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Space Sculptor" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that splits creatures on the battlefield
into sectors."""@en .
:Spectacle rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Spectacle" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that allows certain spells to be cast for
an alternative cost if an opponent has lost life."""@en .
:Splice rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Splice" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a player add a card’s rules text
onto another spell."""@en .
:SplitSecond rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Split Second" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that makes it nearly impossible for a
player to respond to a spell."""@en .
:Spree rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Spree" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """An ability found on some modal spells that allows you to
choose one or more modes and requires you to pay additional costs for
those modes."""@en .
:Squad rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Squad" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that creates copies of a creature when it
enters the battlefield."""@en .
:StartYourEngines rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Start Your Engines!" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that gives a player a speed of 1 if they
have no speed. Once a player has speed, their speed increases once on
each of their turns when an opponent loses life."""@en .
:Station rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Station" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets you tap creatures to add charge
counters to station cards."""@en .
:Storm rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Storm" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that creates copies of a spell."""@en .
:Sunburst rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Sunburst" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that can have a permanent enter the
battlefield with +1/+1 counters or charge counters on it."""@en .
:Surge rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Surge" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that provides an alternative cost to cast
a card if you or one of your teammates has cast another spell in the
same turn."""@en .
:Suspend rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Suspend" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that provides an alternative way to play a
card."""@en .
:Tiered rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Tiered" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability found on some modal spells that requires
you to pay an additional cost for the mode you choose."""@en .
:Toxic rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Toxic" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that causes a player to get poison
counters due to combat damage from creatures with the ability."""@en .
:Training rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Training" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that means “Whenever this creature and at
least one other creature with power greater than this creature’s power
attack, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.”"""@en .
:Trample rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Trample" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that modifies how a creature assigns
combat damage."""@en .
:Transfigure rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Transfigure" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a player search their library
for a replacement creature card."""@en .
:Transmute rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Transmute" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a player search their library
for a replacement card."""@en .
:Tribute rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Tribute" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that allows an opponent to choose between
a creature entering the battlefield with +1/+1 counters or an additional
ability."""@en .
:UmbraArmor rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Umbra Armor" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that allows an Aura to protect the
permanent it’s enchanting."""@en .
:Undaunted rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Undaunted" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that reduces the cost of a spell based on
the number of opponents you have."""@en .
:Undying rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Undying" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that can return a creature from the
graveyard to the battlefield."""@en .
:Unearth rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Unearth" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a player return a creature card
from their graveyard to the battlefield."""@en .
:Unleash rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Unleash" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that allows a creature to enter the
battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it and stops it from blocking if it
has a +1/+1 counter on it."""@en .
:Vanishing rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Vanishing" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that limits how long a permanent remains
on the battlefield."""@en .
:Vigilance rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Vigilance" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that lets a creature attack without
tapping."""@en .
:Visit rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Visit" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability found on Attraction cards. It provides an
effect whenever you roll to visit your attractions and get certain
results."""@en .
:Ward rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Ward" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A triggered ability that can counter spells or abilities
that target the permanent with ward."""@en .
:Warp rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Warp" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability found on permanent cards that allows them
to be cast for an alternative cost."""@en .
:WebSlinging rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Web-slinging" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that allows spells to be cast for an
alternative cost by returning a tapped creature you control to its
owner’s hand."""@en .
:Wither rdf:type :KeywordAbility ;
                 rdfs:label "Wither" ;
                 rdfs:comment
                 """A keyword ability that affects how an object deals damage to
a creature."""@en .

